          "title": "全",
          "content": "<p>周期工程师就是一个人负责完整的软件生命周期：设计，开发，测试，部署，操作和支持。</p>\n<p>-- <a href=\"https://medium.com/@eminetto/full-stack-vs-full-cycle-developer-2a454942291b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">《从全栈工程师到全周期工程师》</a></p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "《从全栈工程师到全周期工程师》",
              "url": "https://medium.com/@eminetto/full-stack-vs-full-cycle-developer-2a454942291b"
            }
